## **4. Initial software setup**

We'll use these models:

| Purpose    | Model              |
| ---------- | ------------------ |
| LLM        | `llama3.2:3b`      |
| Embeddings | `nomic-embed-text` |
| Vector DB  | ChromaDB           |

Install the initial Python packages:

```
pip install ollama chromadb
```

Download the models:

```
ollama pull llama3.2:3b
ollama pull nomic-embed-text
```

Later we'll add LangChain, FastAPI, document parsers and evaluation libraries.

